# The Remotion video project stays untracked, with one exception: the shared
# sound palette is generated once by the nylo-shorts skill and reused by every
# film, so it must survive a clean checkout rather than costing credits again.
# Git cannot re-include a path under an excluded directory, hence the walk down.
video/*
!video/public/
video/public/*
!video/public/sfx/
tweet-posts/
video/public/sfx
